      "releaseNotes": "• Bypass link shorteners: Fixed a bug introduced in version 27.1 where the destination URL failed to load if you have no redirect rules\n• Stop link trackers: Remove additional parameters from Amazon URLs\n• Stop link trackers: Fixed removal of the \"si\" parameter from YouTube playlist URLs",
